{"id":"e17f40587f032600","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-FS-strength.md","title":"FS 与有限迭代组合真理有相同算术后果","display":"thm-FS-strength — FS 与有限迭代组合真理有相同算术后果","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-FS-strength","aliases":["91-thm-FS-strength","91-thm-FS-proof-theoretic"],"display":"thm-FS-strength — FS 与有限迭代组合真理有相同算术后果","depends_on":["[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-ramified-truth]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-FS-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-FS-strength</span><span>91-thm-FS-proof-theoretic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-FS-strength — FS 与有限迭代组合真理有相同算术后果"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"706acac2c3076a7b\" href=\"?note=706acac2c3076a7b\" title=\"91-df-ramified-truth\">91-df-ramified-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span> 为原书全归纳版本，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"706acac2c3076a7b\" href=\"?note=706acac2c3076a7b\" title=\"91-df-ramified-truth\">91-df-ramified-truth</a> 的八子句与全层语言归纳。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为算术后果等价。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>下界 Theorem 14.26 在 FS 中定义每个有限层的迭代真理；上界 Theorem 14.31 将每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_n\\)</span> 证明译入有限层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;2n}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;2n}\\)</span>，且在算术句上翻译为恒等。因此两方向逐句相合，得到 Corollary 14.32。\n去掉 CONEC 后仍有相同算术后果，是原书同时给出的结论。它不等于 CONEC 在全真理语言中可消去，也不等于 FS 与 KF 的全部真理句可以互译。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorems 14.26、14.31、Corollary 14.32，印刷页 166–171，尤其 PDF 页 179–182。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ramified-truth","status":"resolved","id":"706acac2c3076a7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ramified-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ramified-truth","status":"resolved","id":"706acac2c3076a7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FS}$ 为原书全归纳版本，$\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}$ 使用 [[91-df-ramified-truth]] 的八子句与全层语言归纳。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<2n}","display":false}],"bytes":1360,"backlinks":[{"id":"d0dc2670ffdd2806","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-FS-strength]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]